<title>THAILAND: Ayudhya CMG to issue 80 mln new shares.</title>
<headline>Ayudhya CMG to issue 80 mln new shares.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's Ayudhya CMG Life Assurance Plc said on Monday it will raise registered capital to 1.01 billion baht ($40.4 million) from 210 million by issuing 80 million new shares at 10 baht par.</p>
<p>All of the new shares will be offered to existing shareholders through a rights issue, Ayudhya said in a filing to the Stock Exchange of Thailand.</p>
<p>Other details on the new share issue will be considered by the company's shareholders in a meeting on August 6, it said. ($1 = 25 baht)</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
